('mren', 'historija', 'Prije dolaska Osmanlija ovaj kraj pripada dvjema srednjovjekovnim župama. Jedna je Sana, a druga?', 'Before the Ottomans arrived this area belonged to two medieval counties. One is Sana, what is the other?', '["Usora","Mren","Soli","Zagorje"]', '["Usora","Mren","Soli","Zagorje"]', '2', 'Mren. Grad Mren bio je središte svoje župe, ali s osmanskim osvajanjem nestaje iz izvora.', 'Mren. The town of Mren was the centre of its county, but disappears from the sources with the Ottoman conquest.', 'Stranica Historija (ova stranica)', 'historija'),
